{"id":"u-e2461b4d-bbd6-4ab7-b2bf-ce138a3f8394","src":"community","title":"Smolov Jr","author":"Chris C.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/6J9hai-smolov-jr","desc":"This program is designed to be used for 12 weeks in 3x 4 week blocks.\n\nIt goes on the basis of 3 main lifts, squat bench deadlift - but on all days other than Saturday it only does 2.\n\nYou bench 4x a week however.\n\nThe goal is to get volume in at the lower intensity days, but keep the volume high on the higher intensity days with shorter reps but more sets.\n\nIt goes: \n\nDay 1: 6x6 at 70%\nDay 2: 7x5 at 75%\nRest Day \nDay 3: 8x4 at 80%\nRest Day \nDay 4: 10x3 at 85%\nRest Day \n\nDay 1/2 don't need rest between - they're lighter intentionally.\n\nAfter week one, you add 2.5kg to every lift and go again from 70-85% meaning your new 70% is now 2.5kg up.\n\nAfter 3 weeks, you do a deload week of 60% and focus on explosivity, then retest on day 3 your maximums. \n\nThen start again.","level":["Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":150,"joins":13,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-07-22T04:48:10.155Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["70% Day  (6x6)","75% Day (7x5)","80% Day (8x4)","85% Day (10x3)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":70,"x":6}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":70,"x":6}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":15,"pct":40},{"r":13,"pct":50},{"r":12,"pct":60}]},{"n":"Lying Leg Curl","sets":[{"r":15,"pct":40},{"r":13,"pct":50},{"r":12,"pct":60}]},{"n":"French Press","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":7,"x":2},{"r":10,"rpe":6.5,"x":2},{"r":10,"rpe":6,"x":2},{"r":10,"rpe":6.5,"x":2},{"r":10,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"r":15,"pct":40},{"r":13,"pct":50},{"r":12,"pct":60}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":75,"x":7}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":75,"x":7}]},{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"r":12,"pct":60},{"r":10,"pct":65},{"r":8,"pct":70},{"r"